meta {
  name: getPriceLists
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: https://{{customer}}.{{domain}}/jsonrpc
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "getPriceLists",
    "params": {},
    "id": 1
  }
}

docs {
  Retrieve price lists

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | `page` | integer | no | Page number (1-based) |
  | `limit` | integer | no | Maximum number of results per page (1–1000) |

  **Example: All price lists**

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "getPriceLists",
    "params": {},
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "price_lists": [
      {
        "price_list_id": 1,
        "currency_code": "EUR",
        "price_list_code": "CON",
        "price_list_name": "Consumer",
        "order": 1
      },
      {
        "price_list_id": 2,
        "currency_code": "EUR",
        "price_list_code": "TRD",
        "price_list_name": "Trade",
        "order": 2
      }
    ],
    "page": {
      "number_of_items": 2,
      "items_per_page": 1000,
      "number_of_pages": 1,
      "current_page": 1
    }
  }
  ```
}
